<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept vehicle exports rise 11.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept vehicle exports rise 11.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's vehicle exports in September rose 11.5 percent from a year earlier to 348,623, the Japan Automobile Manufacturers Association (JAMA) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In the April to September period, exports fell 0.2 percent from the year-ago period to 1,826,366 vehicles.  </p>
<p>					   SEPT	   YR/YR PCT</p>
<p> Cars				  265,456	    +11.3</p>
<p>    Large			    115,565	    +26.8</p>
<p>    Compact			  149,060	     +1.6</p>
<p>    Mini				   831	    +40.1</p>
<p> Trucks				 79,405	    +11.8</p>
<p>    Heavy			     60,670	    +14.8</p>
<p>    Light			     18,686	     +2.7</p>
<p>    Mini				    49	   +226.7</p>
<p>    Buses				3,762	    +18.4</p>
<p> Total				 348,623	    +11.5</p>
<p>Exports by destination:</p>
<p> Asia				   56,473	     -4.7</p>
<p> Middle East			  29,125	    +54.0</p>
<p> Europe				 82,205	     +8.5</p>
<p> - EU				   66,288	     +3.1</p>
